{{Splblocknotes
| name = Dead Shot
| desc = Procs [[Spell Block]] sources on the initial target only.
}}
{{Disjointnotes
| name = Dead Shot
| desc = Destroying the target {{M|tree}} {{M|disjoints}} the first projectile.
}}
{{Splduplicatenotes
| name = Muerta Dead Shot
| desc = Launches two projectiles simultaneously at both the primary and secondary target, the ricochet projectile bounces in the opposite direction and parallel to the vector-targeted direction.
}}

 * {{Symbol|Projectile|Base}}
** The ability has two [[projectile]] components, both with a {{#var:Dead Shot basic1}}-{{M|projectile speed}}.
** Considers {{M|clones}} and {{M|creep-heroes}} as heroes, and {{M|illusions}} as creeps.
** {{Symbol|Target|Unit}}
*** The projectile travels forward by default if no {{Symbol|Target|Vector}} [[vector-targeted]] direction is selected.
**** Does not apply when targeting {{M|trees}}.
** {{Symbol|Projectile|Bounce-to}}
*** The initial projectile takes {{Symbol|bonus cas}} {{#expr:{{#var:Dead Shot value1}}/{{#var:Dead Shot basic1}}}} ({{Symbol|bonus t1r}} {{ValueColor||{{#expr:{{#var:Dead Shot value1 tal}}/{{#var:Dead Shot basic1}}}}|10tal}}) seconds to reach its max distance.
*** {{Symbol|Projectile|Impact}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Trees}}
**** Destroyes the {{Symbol|Target|Unit}} unit-targeted [[tree]] upon projectile impact.
** {{Symbol|Projectile|Bounce-off}}
*** The projectile ricochets even if it kills the targeted unit.
*** {{Symbol|Projectile|Travel}}
**** The {{M|magical|x}} {{M|spell damage|x}} affects creeps within its effect radius while the ricochet projectile is traveling forward.
*** {{Symbol|Vision|Flying}}
**** Grants a non-lingering 115-radius [[flying vision]] as the ricochet projectile travels.
*** {{Symbol|Projectile|In}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
**** Has a max travel distance of {{#expr:{{#var:Dead Shot value1}}*{{#var:Dead Shot type2 value1}}}} ({{Symbol|bonus t1r}} {{ValueColor||{{#expr:{{#var:Dead Shot value1 tal}}*{{#var:Dead Shot type2 value1}}}}|10tal}}) range by default.
**** Takes {{Symbol|bonus cas}} {{#expr:{{#var:Dead Shot value1}}*{{#var:Dead Shot type2 value1}}/{{#var:Dead Shot basic1}}}} ({{Symbol|bonus t1r}} {{ValueColor||{{#expr:{{#var:Dead Shot value1 tal}}*{{#var:Dead Shot type2 value1}}/{{#var:Dead Shot basic1}} round2}}|10tal}}) seconds to reach its max distance.
*** {{Symbol|Projectile|Impact}}
**** The richochet projectile stops in the following conditions:
***** Upon reaching the max distance.
***** Upon impact on an enemy hero within its effect radius.

* Affects enemy units up to {{Symbol|bonus cas}} {{Symbol|bonus aoe}} {{#expr:{{#var:Dead Shot value1}}*(1+{{#var:Dead Shot type2 value1}})+{{#var:Dead Shot type2 value2}}}} ({{Symbol|bonus t1r}} {{ValueColor||{{#expr:{{#var:Dead Shot value1 tal}}*(1+{{#var:Dead Shot type2 value1}})+{{#var:Dead Shot type2 value2}}}}|10tal}}) with the travel distance and end radius. 

* {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}}
** The {{M|fear}} causes the affected enemy to run away in the same direction as the incoming hit projectile.
** Reapplying the fear debuff refreshes its duration.
** [[Movement Speed#Set Movement Speed|Sets]] the fear-affected hero's current movement speed as its base movement speed.
** Grants the affected enemy {{M|phase movement}}.

